id: card
name: Card (tonal, elevated, outlined, interactive)
category: containers
summary: A grouped surface for related content. Expressive cards are tonal and generously rounded, not shadowed.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Shape large-increased (20dp). Padding 16dp (24dp from the expanded breakpoint).
- Default is tonal: surface-3 container, no shadow. Elevated uses surface-1 plus elevation 1. Outlined uses surface with a 1px outline-variant border.
- Title: Title Medium (or Title Large for a hero card). Body: Body Medium. Supporting meta: Body Small on-surface-variant.
- Interactive card (a whole-card link) gets state layers and a focus ring. Only one interactive target per card unless it is a list of actions.
- Do not nest cards. Group with spacing or a divider instead.
@@a11y
- The card title is a real heading at the right level for the outline (h2 or h3), not a styled div.
- A whole-card link: put the link on the heading and stretch it over the card with ::after, so there is exactly one link and the name is the title.
- Media gets alt text, or alt="" when decorative.
@@html
<article class="md-card">
  <h3 class="md-card__title">Copper, five years</h3>
  <p class="md-card__body">$10,000 would be about $15,000 today.</p>
  <p class="md-card__meta">Source: daily prices, updated every six hours.</p>
  <div class="md-card__actions">
    <button class="md-btn md-btn--text" type="button">Details</button>
  </div>
</article>

<!-- whole-card link -->
<article class="md-card md-card--interactive">
  <h3 class="md-card__title"><a class="md-card__link" href="/guide">Read the full guide</a></h3>
  <p class="md-card__body">One link, stretched over the card.</p>
</article>

<article class="md-card md-card--outlined"> ... </article>
<article class="md-card md-card--elevated"> ... </article>
@@css
.md-card {
  --_bg: var(--md-surface-3);
  --_c: var(--md-on-surface);
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sp-sm);
  padding: var(--sp-lg);
  border-radius: var(--shape-lg-inc);
  background-color: var(--_bg);
  color: var(--_c);
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-default-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-default-effects),
    box-shadow var(--md-spring-default-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-default-effects),
    border-radius var(--md-spring-default-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-default-spatial);
}

.md-card--elevated { --_bg: var(--md-surface-1); box-shadow: var(--md-elev-1); }
.md-card--outlined {
  --_bg: var(--md-surface);
  border: 0.0625rem solid var(--md-outline-variant);
}

.md-card__title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-medium-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-medium-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-title-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-medium-tracking);
}

.md-card__body {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-medium-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-medium-tracking);
}

.md-card__meta {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-small-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-small-tracking);
}

.md-card__actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--sp-sm);
  margin-top: var(--sp-xs);
}

.md-card__link { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.md-card__link::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; }

.md-card--interactive { cursor: pointer; }
.md-card--interactive:hover {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 8%, var(--_bg));
  border-radius: var(--shape-xl);
}
.md-card--interactive:has(.md-card__link:focus-visible) {
  outline: 0.1875rem solid var(--md-secondary);
  outline-offset: 0.125rem;
}

@media (min-width: 52.5rem) {
  .md-card { padding: var(--sp-xl); }
}
